<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1856_6893.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unser fründtlich willig dienst, sampt <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">waß</unclear> wir ehren
<lb n="2"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">liebß</unclear> und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">guotz</unclear> vermögend zuo vor <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">from</unclear> fürsichtig ersam wyß.
<lb n="3"/>insunders guot fründ, und gethrüw lieb <orgName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Eydtgnoßen</unclear></orgName>, wir
<lb n="4"/>sind von <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unserm</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wylen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">lieben</unclear>, und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gethrüwen</unclear>, mit rath.
<lb n="5"/>und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">landtzstadthalter</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hern</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Adam</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Böniger</unclear></persName>. (<unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">näbent</unclear> Inlegung
<lb n="6"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">eineß</unclear> fründtlichen, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">von</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">üch</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">an</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">inne</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">abgangnen</unclear> schribens.)
